Archive the 3 custom market-data providers (CoinGecko, Frankfurter-ECB,
Onvista-LSX) as a markdown + SQL backup so they can be re-created after any
clean-DB rebuild — they live in app_settings/market_data_custom_providers,
outside git, so they were lost on resets. Also gitignore scripts/__pycache__
bytecode, and stamp the TR Importer enable log with a build marker.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
